title: Rathenau is murdered!
subtitle: The foreign minister is shot on the Koenigsallee.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1922 and month = 6
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
RG.news('Rathenau murdered in the Grunewald', 3);
RG.district('berlin', {militancy: 6});
Q.rathenau_murdered = 1;
Q.stability -= 6;
Q.inflation = Math.min(100, Q.inflation + 4);
!}

= Rathenau is murdered!

On the morning of 24 June Walther Rathenau is driven in an open car from his villa to the Foreign Office. On the Koenigsallee a second car draws alongside, and the men in it open fire with a machine pistol and throw a grenade. The killers belong to the Organisation Consul, the Freikorps veterans who shot Erzberger last summer.

On 27 June hundreds of thousands march in Berlin alone. In the Reichstag Chancellor Wirth points at the nationalist benches: "The enemy stands on the right." For once the SPD, the USPD and the unions sit down with us, and they propose a joint programme against the monarchist leagues.

- @front: Sign the joint programme.
- @strike: Call our own general strike.
- @squads: Form defence squads in every district.

@front
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Joint defence committees in the towns, for the rest of the year. The SPD sets the terms.
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids any agreement with the social democrats.
on-arrival: {!
if (!RG.e22) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.e22_lib.onArrival); }
RG.e22.against('united_front');
RG.ecci('radek', 5);
Q.e22_rathenau_front = 1;
Q.spd_relation += 10;
Q.worker_support += 5;
Q.lean_unionist += 3;
!}

The four organisations march together on 4 July. A week later the SPD executive drops us from the agreement under pressure from the Centre. In a hundred towns the joint committees go on meeting anyway.

@strike
subtitle: Berlin, Halle and Chemnitz come out. The SPD will not.
view-if: offensive_gone = 0
on-arrival: {!
RG.startStrike('berlin');
RG.startStrike('halle', true);
RG.district('saxony', {militancy: 6});
RG.ecci('bukharin', 5);
Q.e22_rathenau_front = 2;
Q.spd_relation -= 5;
Q.lean_offensive += 3;
!}

Our call brings out the big works of Berlin, Halle and Chemnitz for a day. Elsewhere the unions' protests are bigger and quieter.

@squads
subtitle: [? if lock_uprising = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Young workers drilling in Berlin, Saxony and Halle. The police will call it an army.
choose-if: lock_uprising < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids armed formations.
on-arrival: {!
if (!RG.e22) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.e22_lib.onArrival); }
RG.e22.against('uprising');
RG.district('berlin', {guards: 1.5, repression: 4});
RG.district('saxony', {guards: 1.5});
RG.district('halle', {guards: 1, repression: 4});
RG.ecci('trotsky', 3);
Q.e22_rathenau_front = 3;
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
!}

In the weeks after the murder, squads of young workers drill in the courtyards of Wedding and the woods outside Chemnitz.
